{"id":"despite-whereas","lv":"b2","n":33,"cat":"clauses","t":"Despite, in spite of, whereas, while","en":"despite + danh từ / V-ing · whereas · while","sum":"Despite / in spite of + danh từ hoặc V-ing = mặc dù (KHÔNG theo sau là mệnh đề): Despite the rain, the river looks beautiful. In spite of being tired, I'm glad we came. Muốn dùng mệnh đề: despite the fact that + mệnh đề, hoặc gọn hơn although + mệnh đề. Không nói despite of, không nói in spite the rain. Whereas / while = trong khi, so sánh hai điều trái nhau: You love rainy days, whereas I prefer sunshine. While còn nghĩa “trong lúc”, nên whereas rõ nghĩa hơn khi viết.","forms":[{"f":"despite / in spite of + danh từ / V-ing","vi":"Despite the rain, we went out."},{"f":"despite the fact that + mệnh đề","vi":"Despite the fact that it rained, we went out."},{"f":"although + mệnh đề","vi":"Although it rained, we went out."},{"f":"whereas / while = trong khi (đối lập)","vi":"I love coffee, whereas she prefers tea."}],"pts":[{"id":"despite-in-spite-of","name":"despite / in spite of","vi":"Despite + danh từ / V-ing (không theo sau mệnh đề)"},{"id":"whereas-while","name":"whereas / while (contrast)","vi":"Whereas, while: so sánh hai sự việc trái nhau"}],"cast":{"ana":{"name":{"en":"Ana","vi":"Ana"},"look":"woman","style":{"outfit":"jacket","top":"#8C3B4A","topShade":"#76303D","accent":"#A23B55","hair":"curly","hairColor":"#2B1D18","skin":"#8D5A3C","skinShade":"#784A30"},"x":560},"mia":{"name":{"en":"Mia","vi":"Mia"},"look":"woman","style":{"outfit":"blouse","top":"#D9774F","topShade":"#BF6340","accent":"#C8603B","hair":"long","hairColor":"#6B4226"},"x":1040}},"bg":"riverside","beats":[{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Despite the rain, the river looks beautiful today.","vi":"Dù trời mưa, hôm nay con sông vẫn đẹp.","ipa":["dɪˈspaɪt","ðə","ɹeɪn","ðə","ˈɹɪvɚ","lʊks","ˈbjutəfəl","təˈdeɪ"],"who":"ana","ann":{"expression":"happy"},"b":1,"start":0.476,"end":2.996,"timing":[[0,0.476],[1,0.861],[2,0.986],[3,1.324],[4,1.449],[5,1.749],[6,2.024],[7,2.499]]},{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"I agree. In spite of being tired, I'm glad we came.","vi":"Đồng ý. Dù mệt, tôi vẫn mừng vì mình đã đến.","ipa":["aɪ","əˈɡɹi","ɪn","spaɪt","ʌv","ˈbiɪŋ","ˈtaɪɚd","aɪm","ɡlæd","wi","keɪm"],"who":"mia","ann":{"expression":"happy"},"b":1,"start":3.786,"end":7.536,"timing":[[0,3.786],[1,3.873],[2,4.724],[3,4.974],[4,5.323],[5,5.411],[6,5.636],[7,6.398],[8,6.599],[9,6.923],[10,7.036]]},{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"You love rainy days, whereas I prefer sunshine.","vi":"Chị thích ngày mưa, trong khi em lại thích trời nắng.","ipa":["ju","lʌv","ˈɹeɪni","deɪz","wɛˈɹæz","aɪ","pɹəˈfɝ","ˈsʌnˌʃaɪn"],"who":"ana","ann":{"expression":"thinking"},"b":1,"start":8.326,"end":10.936,"timing":[[0,8.326],[1,8.424],[2,8.674],[3,8.986],[4,9.374],[5,9.724],[6,9.799],[7,10.198]]},{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"True. But today, we both like it!","vi":"Đúng. Nhưng hôm nay thì cả hai đều thích!","ipa":["tɹu","bʌt","təˈdeɪ","wi","boʊθ","laɪk","ɪt"],"who":"mia","ann":{"expression":"happy"},"b":1,"start":11.726,"end":14.066,"timing":[[0,11.726],[1,12.461],[2,12.661],[3,13.086],[4,13.261],[5,13.561],[6,13.798]]},{"k":"n","sec":"hook","parts":[{"e":"Despite the rain"},{"v":", "},{"e":"in spite of being tired"},{"v":": mặc dù, theo sau là danh từ hoặc động từ thêm "},{"e":"ing"},{"v":", chứ không phải một mệnh đề. Còn "},{"e":"whereas I prefer sunshine"},{"v":": trong khi, so sánh hai điều trái ngược nhau."}],"b":1,"start":14.706,"end":28.526},{"k":"n","sec":"form","parts":[{"v":"Cùng nghĩa “mặc dù”, nhưng khác cấu trúc. Sau "},{"e":"although"},{"v":" là một mệnh đề đầy đủ. Sau "},{"e":"despite"},{"v":" là danh từ hoặc "},{"e":"ing"},{"v":". Muốn dùng mệnh đề sau "},{"e":"despite"},{"v":", phải thêm "},{"e":"the fact that"},{"v":"."}],"b":2,"start":29.516,"end":43.776},{"k":"n","sec":"form","parts":[{"v":"Đổi "},{"e":"although"},{"v":" thành "},{"e":"despite"},{"v":", thì mệnh đề "},{"e":"it was raining"},{"v":" phải rút lại thành một danh từ: "},{"e":"the rain"},{"v":"."}],"b":3,"start":44.416,"end":51.526,"cues":[[0,46.196]]},{"k":"e","sec":"examples","en":"Despite his age, he runs every morning.","vi":"Dù đã có tuổi, sáng nào ông ấy cũng chạy bộ.","ipa":["dɪˈspaɪt","hɪz","eɪdʒ","hi","ɹʌnz","ˈɛvɚi","ˈmɔɹnɪŋ"],"hl":[[0,7,"c"],[8,15,"k"]],"b":4,"start":52.416,"end":54.756,"timing":[[0,52.416],[1,52.789],[2,52.964],[3,53.551],[4,53.676],[5,54.014],[6,54.251]]},{"k":"e","sec":"examples","en":"In spite of having a cold, she went to work.","vi":"Dù bị cảm, cô ấy vẫn đi làm.","ipa":["ɪn","spaɪt","ʌv","ˈhævɪŋ","ə","koʊld","ʃi","wɛnt","tu","wɝk"],"hl":[[0,11,"c"],[12,18,"k"]],"b":5,"start":55.396,"end":57.876,"timing":[[0,55.396],[1,55.533],[2,55.871],[3,55.946],[4,56.258],[5,56.334],[6,56.946],[7,57.133],[8,57.358],[9,57.471]]},{"k":"e","sec":"examples","en":"Some people love the city, whereas others prefer the countryside.","vi":"Có người mê thành phố, trong khi người khác lại thích nông thôn.","ipa":["sʌm","ˈpipəl","lʌv","ðə","ˈsɪti","wɛˈɹæz","ˈʌðɚz","pɹəˈfɝ","ðə","ˈkʌntɹiˌsaɪd"],"hl":[[27,34,"c"]],"b":6,"start":58.516,"end":61.946,"timing":[[0,58.516],[1,58.743],[2,59.069],[3,59.306],[4,59.406],[5,60.018],[6,60.381],[7,60.706],[8,61.093],[9,61.181]]},{"k":"e","sec":"examples","en":"We lost the game despite playing well.","vi":"Chúng tôi thua dù đã chơi tốt.","ipa":["wi","lɔst","ðə","ɡeɪm","dɪˈspaɪt","ˈpleɪɪŋ","wɛl"],"hl":[[17,24,"c"],[25,32,"k"]],"b":7,"start":62.586,"end":64.596,"timing":[[0,62.586],[1,62.684],[2,63.046],[3,63.146],[4,63.409],[5,63.858],[6,64.196]]},{"k":"e","sec":"contrast","en":"I like coffee, whereas my sister likes tea.","vi":"Tôi thích cà phê, trong khi em gái tôi thích trà.","ipa":["aɪ","laɪk","ˈkɑfi","wɛˈɹæz","maɪ","ˈsɪstɚ","laɪks","ti"],"b":8,"start":65.586,"end":68.056,"timing":[[0,65.586],[1,65.626],[2,65.889],[3,66.514],[4,66.788],[5,66.938],[6,67.339],[7,67.651]]},{"k":"e","sec":"contrast","en":"While I was cooking, he watched TV.","vi":"Trong lúc tôi nấu ăn, anh ấy xem tivi.","ipa":["waɪl","